  sourcePath: 'src/pages/equipment/power-swivel.astro',
  path: '/equipment/power-swivel',
  headline: "Power Swivel: Rotation on a Workover Rig Without a Top Drive",
  description: "What a power swivel is, the jobs it's used for on a workover or well-servicing rig, and how it compares to a drilling rig's top drive.",
